` is compiled as the regex `orders.v1`, which also matches unintended names such as `ordersXv1`, and character classes such as `\\d` and `\\w` lose their special meaning. Allow rules written with regex escapes can therefore apply to more resources than the author intended. Depending on the ACL configuration, this may allow an authenticated Kafka client to access a resource (such as read or write a topic) that should have been denied.","type":"unreviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":null,"source_code_location":"","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-655w-c5cf-wj5f","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-128424","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-128424","https://github.com/kroxylicious/kroxylicious/issues/5236","https://github.com/kroxylicious/kroxylicious/pull/5294","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-128424","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2572937","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-655w-c5cf-wj5f"],"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:31:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:31:41Z","github_reviewed_at":null,"nvd_published_at":"2026-11-13T07:17:20Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N","score":5.3},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-863","name":"Incorrect Authorization"}],"credits":[],"comments":0,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N","score":5.3}},{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-jwhv-387h-6546","cve_id":"CVE-2026-111333","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-jwhv-387h-6546","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jwhv-387h-6546","summary":"Memory overflow in an authentication request can lead to unpredictable or erroneous behavior or...","description":"Memory overflow in an authentication request can lead to unpredictable or erroneous behavior or Denial of Service in Citrix NetScaler ADC and Citrix NetScaler Gateway.","type":"unreviewed","severi